{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 50941, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 40414, "uid": 53787, "type": 4, "title": "WB玉藻前 2500w伤害视频+一点心得（更新：2800w）", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1598248385, "updated_at": 1631090517, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1598336668, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 4, "status": 1, "summary": "【天命之子国际服】玉藻前WB，2500w伤害达成视频原地址点这里第一次参加WB活动，好不容易打到了2500w，每天都看大佬的搭配，再改进自己的阵容。阵容搭配好了是比装备更加优先的事情。活动这么多天也有", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1598309029175_540534.jpg,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1598249366030_98505846.jpg,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1598249366030_98505846.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 8, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 9244, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 50941, "content": "<div style=\"min-height:20px;\" class=\"min-height-wrapper\"></div><div class=\"video-play-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><p class=\"video-title\">【天命之子国际服】玉藻前WB，2500w伤害达成</p><div class=\"img-video-div\"><img class=\"uploadVideoImg\" src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/13/3C/ChpCl12MjCCEQOH5AAAAAJ3C1H8813.png\" data-url=\"<iframe src=&quot;//player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=884306472&amp;bvid=BV16K4y1Y7vA&amp;cid=228190846&amp;page=1&quot; scrolling=&quot;no&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; frameborder=&quot;no&quot; framespacing=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot;> </iframe>\" data-video-id=\"50942\" data-title=\"【天命之子国际服】玉藻前WB，2500w伤害达成\" data-tag=\"攻略视频\" data-isb=\"2\" data-is_hot=\"1\" style=\"display: inline;\" alt=\"WB玉藻前 2500w伤害视频+一点心得（更新：2800w）\"><i class=\"icon-video-play\"></i></div></div><div style=\"min-height:20px;\" class=\"min-height-wrapper\"></div><div style=\"text-align: center; min-height: 20px;\" class=\"min-height-wrapper\"><b style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV16K4y1Y7vA/\">视频原地址点这里</a></b></div><div style=\"text-align: left; min-height: 20px;\" class=\"min-height-wrapper\"><br></div><div style=\"min-height:20px;\" class=\"min-height-wrapper\">\n\n<span>第一次参加WB活动，好不容易打到了2500w，每天都看大佬的搭配，再改进自己的阵容。阵容搭配好了是比装备更加优先的事情。活动这么多天也有一些细节心得列在下面。</span>\n\n<br></div><div style=\"min-height:20px;\" class=\"min-height-wrapper\"><br></div><div style=\"min-height:20px;\" class=\"min-height-wrapper\"><div class=\"ordered-ol-wrapper\" data-list-tree=\"[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;ordered-2174555366999098&quot;,&quot;pid&quot;:0,&quot;indent&quot;:1},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;ordered-5085188713843991&quot;,&quot;pid&quot;:0,&quot;indent&quot;:1},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;ordered-76544433387075&quot;,&quot;pid&quot;:0,&quot;indent&quot;:1},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;ordered-7466423506733777&quot;,&quot;pid&quot;:0,&quot;indent&quot;:1},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;ordered-9251926616098589&quot;,&quot;pid&quot;:0,&quot;indent&quot;:1},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;ordered-8449233228863167&quot;,&quot;pid&quot;:0,&quot;indent&quot;:1}]\"><ol class=\"ordered-ol\" data-list-style=\"decimal\" data-list-id=\"ordered-2174555366999098\" data-list-pid=\"0\" data-list-indent=\"1\"><li class=\"ordered-li\" data-list-content=\"1.\">因为有技能预约，水老头只用TS，放在前排吃水妲比的双刃剑就可以了。<b>水妲比会对后排水属天子用SS强化，糖猫也会对后排最高攻5体使用SS强化，</b>水老头放在后排一个SS也放不出来，等于是浪费了一些输出，但是我看群有很多测试这个效果并不理想，可能是由于水老头并不是水刀天子里的最高输出的缘故（我猜的）\n&nbsp;</li></ol><ol class=\"ordered-ol\" data-list-style=\"decimal\" data-list-id=\"ordered-5085188713843991\" data-list-pid=\"0\" data-list-indent=\"1\"><li class=\"ordered-li\" data-list-content=\"2.\"><span>因为FT释放技能的顺序是从左到右，所以水刀天子放在后排前列（第三排），按攻击力从高到低排列（玄学）可能会比较好。\n&nbsp;</span></li></ol><ol class=\"ordered-ol\" data-list-style=\"decimal\" data-list-id=\"ordered-76544433387075\" data-list-pid=\"0\" data-list-indent=\"1\"><li class=\"ordered-li\" data-list-content=\"3.\"><span>DS循环有单循环光月月的，也有光月月&gt;木人鱼，也有木人鱼&gt;光月月，还有木人鱼&gt;光月月&gt;火莫娜的。这个的伤害量真的要看自己的队伍配置。我个人是光月月&gt;木人鱼来回循环。&nbsp;</span></li></ol><ol class=\"ordered-ol\" data-list-style=\"decimal\" data-list-id=\"ordered-7466423506733777\" data-list-pid=\"0\" data-list-indent=\"1\"><li class=\"ordered-li\" data-list-content=\"4.\"><span>队长优先狗哥&gt;狗姐</span></li></ol><ol class=\"ordered-ol\" data-list-style=\"decimal\" data-list-id=\"ordered-9251926616098589\" data-list-pid=\"0\" data-list-indent=\"1\"><li class=\"ordered-li\" data-list-content=\"5.\"><span>我的水刀们的攻击力由高到低是水老头&gt;水女警&gt;莎乐美&gt;水护士，上更多的刀不一定会造成更高的伤害，反而会抢走本该高输出的水刀伤害。比利的伤害不容小觑。</span></li></ol><ol class=\"ordered-ol\" data-list-style=\"decimal\" data-list-id=\"ordered-8449233228863167\" data-list-pid=\"0\" data-list-indent=\"1\"><li class=\"ordered-li\" data-list-content=\"6.\"><span>我的技能预约设置\n嫦娥 S&gt;T\n水老头 T\n光月月 S&gt;T\n水女警 T&gt;S，伤害爆炸，1分18秒伤害14.7w，说点火以后水女警PVP直接蒸发对面我觉得一点也不夸张&nbsp;</span></li></ol></div></div><div style=\"min-height:20px;\" class=\"min-height-wrapper\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;其他全部设置为 S&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"min-height:20px;\" class=\"min-height-wrapper\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"min-height:20px;\" class=\"min-height-wrapper\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">我的装备很一般，因为懒得把PVP队伍里的装备换来换去，所以用的都是普通+15装备。附魔也都是随便点了两下，B级附魔不超过5个。只有水老头有一个S属性的攻击类词条。留待下次时间了再调整。\n没有上卢茵(木枪)的原因是因为加值太低，加上一身破烂装备生存有压力，所以就上了光莫娜帮忙稳住血线。算是放弃了一点输出。</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><br></div><div style=\"min-height:20px;\" class=\"min-height-wrapper\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"min-height:20px;\" class=\"min-height-wrapper\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n\n<span>友情推荐两个大佬的视频，是他们的珠玉在前，对我帮助很大。&nbsp;</span></span></div><div style=\"min-height:20px;\" class=\"min-height-wrapper\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span>1. <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/av754303581?p=1&amp;t=1 \">M1nFF 伤害3500w</a></span></span></div><div style=\"min-height:20px;\" class=\"min-height-wrapper\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span>2. <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/av969345381?p=1&amp;t=842 \">Mxx 伤害2200w</a>&nbsp;</span><span></span></span></div><div style=\"min-height:20px;\" class=\"min-height-wrapper\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span>顺带一提Mxx提供非常详细的解说，以及为什么要这样配队。</span>\n\n<br></span></div><div style=\"min-height:20px;\" class=\"min-height-wrapper\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"min-height:20px;\" class=\"min-height-wrapper\">其他的各种攻略wiki里非常详细就不列举了</div><div style=\"min-height:20px;\" class=\"min-height-wrapper\"><br></div><div style=\"min-height:20px;\" class=\"min-height-wrapper\"><div><div><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1598249366030_98505846.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1598249366030_98505846.jpg\" alt=\"WB玉藻前 2500w伤害视频+一点心得（更新：2800w）\"></div><div><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center; \"><b>贼开心</b></div><div style=\"text-align: center; \"><b><br></b></div><div style=\"text-align: center; \"><b><div><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1598309029175_540534.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1598309029175_540534.jpg\" alt=\"WB玉藻前 2500w伤害视频+一点心得（更新：2800w）\"></div><div><br></div><div>08/25更新，2800w但是忘了录视频</div><div>一模一样的配置，只是运气好</div><br></b></div><br></div><br></div><div></div><br>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1598309029175_540534.jpg", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1598249366030_98505846.jpg", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1598249366030_98505846.jpg"], "model_list": [], "user": {"